{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KGrHPxowEwRPYxdNXkK48Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Project State Summary\n\n**Problem**: go-unix-utils stress-tests a spec-driven code generation pipeline by reimplementing GNU coreutils/moreutils in Go and verifying parity via differential testing against Homebrew reference binaries.\n\n**Architecture**: SRDs define requirements → orchestrator generates Go code in `cmd/` → `pkg/testutils` runs differential tests comparing Go binary output against GNU reference binary (stdout, stderr, exit code). Shared infrastructure lives in `pkg/sys`, `pkg/format`, `pkg/testutils`, `pkg/hashutil`, `pkg/sizeparse`, `pkg/encutil`.\n\n**Current state**: ~60+ utilities implemented across releases 00.0–10.1. Most recent work: srd094 (nice) R2.1–R2.3 just completed. Many utilities remain \"not started\" across releases 11.0–15.0.\n\n**Current release focus**: Release 11.0 is the earliest incomplete release with ready requirements. Only srd095-nohup has requirements in \"ready\" state (srd094-nice was just worked on, srd093-mknod is not in requirement_states). Release 11.1 (users, who, pinky) is next.\n\n## Priority Reasoning\n\nEarliest incomplete releases with ready requirements:\n1. **Release 11.0**: srd095-nohup (7 ready requirements: R1.1–R1.4, R2.1–R2.3)\n2. **Release 11.1**: srd096-users (6 ready), srd097-who (11 ready), srd098-pinky (9 ready)\n\nWith a 4-task limit, I'll cover nohup (2 tasks) and users (2 tasks), completing srd095 and srd096.\n\n## Weight Budget Check\n\nAssuming default weight 1 (no weight-4 requirements indicated for releases 11.0/11.1; weight-4 isolation is noted only for release 15.0 SRDs):\n\n```\nTask 0: srd095 R1.1(w=1) + R1.2(w=1) + R1.3(w=1) + R1.4(w=1) = 4 ≤ 4 ✓\nTask 1: srd095 R2.1(w=1) + R2.2(w=1) + R2.3(w=1) = 3 ≤ 4 ✓\nTask 2: srd096 R1.1(w=1) + R1.2(w=1) + R1.3(w=1) = 3 ≤ 4 ✓\nTask 3: srd096 R2.1(w=1) + R2.2(w=1) + R2.3(w=1) = 3 ≤ 4 ✓\